{
 "note": "payloadHash(op, space, fields) = base64url(SHA-256(UTF-8 of canonical({ op, space, fields }))), `fields` NESTED; canonical = JSON with keys sorted at every level, no whitespace, undefined dropped. Every implementation (kernel/seal/wire.js, native-core's signer, app-wire's apps/app/src/real/payload-hash.js) must reproduce `hash` and `canonical` for each case.",
